      "remediation": {
        "description": "VPC CNI NetworkPolicy is enabled but no firewall rule cleanup mechanism is configured for completed pods.",
        "action": "Option 1: Enable the TTLAfterFinished feature gate at cluster level. Option 2: Set ttlSecondsAfterFinished on all Job specs. Option 3: Update VPC CNI to a version with pod completion handling. Verify VPC CNI version:\n  kubectl describe daemonset aws-node -n kube-system | grep Image"
      },
